{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE HEART-POUNDING DRAW</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your turn, draw items one by one. After each draw, face the choice: keep your loot or draw more and risk losing everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/ff34eb42519d6f48908ab5e28ec84635.poster.avif?t=1773567809\" width=960 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/ff34eb42519d6f48908ab5e28ec84635.webm?t=1773567809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/ff34eb42519d6f48908ab5e28ec84635.mp4?t=1773567809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pool is a dynamic mix of valuable and dangerous items:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resources:</strong> The foundation for crafting powerful items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blueprints:</strong> Unlock new, game-changing crafting recipes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Junk:</strong> Drawing two identical Junk items in a row <strong>interrupts your turn</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unstable Core:</strong> Drawing two of these <strong>interrupts your turn and deals damage!</strong></p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTROL THE CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your loot to buy or craft special items that let you manipulate the pool, protect yourself, or sabotage your opponents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/51dc09232ef70420ed5be7d4ce8f4cbd.poster.avif?t=1773567809\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/51dc09232ef70420ed5be7d4ce8f4cbd.webm?t=1773567809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/51dc09232ef70420ed5be7d4ce8f4cbd.mp4?t=1773567809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against friends and remember: this isn't about getting the most resources \u2014 it's about <strong>survival</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The last surviving player wins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/071c1b37cc8ccf290a3053a536196c3f.poster.avif?t=1773567809\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/071c1b37cc8ccf290a3053a536196c3f.webm?t=1773567809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/071c1b37cc8ccf290a3053a536196c3f.mp4?t=1773567809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/275f5cbf5c1a5530b42ea3da802d221b.poster.avif?t=1773567809\" width=960 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/275f5cbf5c1a5530b42ea3da802d221b.webm?t=1773567809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/275f5cbf5c1a5530b42ea3da802d221b.mp4?t=1773567809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Smart Move","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4017930/149cae4666a3b60cea152ab583d8af40d27dc51e.jpg"},{"name":"Twice in a Row","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4017930/f4f61de55bfc2378fa851bb7f156296489e6137f.jpg"},{"name":"Greed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4017930/3cdbebb30ec37e01fc2450468a0251d02a38543e.jpg"},{"name":"Too Easy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4017930/b68b642ea938dc2ea47fc0b9b4c4dc2cfa4bf3e0.jpg"},{"name":"Heart of Gold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4017930/a1f9ec266f5ba0fb49c5cb27cdf6a71d2dfc71a0.jpg"},{"name":"Deep Pockets","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4017930/df68c7971c7290cfdb8ac020cd4debf5a6fd1a30.jpg"},{"name":"BOMBA","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4017930/7e83191fd4fecf50f329eeff6018c6ad1b91db8b.jpg"},{"name":"Unlucky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4017930/159c50a671c237cfbaf4cb7871040e0b9fa8ce9f.jpg"},{"name":"Hold It For Me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4017930/0ab688c11c1935ed75cb3b71075cde1ce6afff55.jpg"},{"name":"Counter Strike","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4017930/7099400f000d322bb5436b7999127ad16b007670.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4017930?t=1773567809","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/129774fab54772eeb343f24146439a9873fa7502/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773567809","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/