e-changing crafting recipes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Junk:</strong> Drawing two identical Junk items in a row <strong>interrupts your turn</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unstable Core:</strong> Drawing two of these <strong>interrupts your turn and deals damage!</strong></p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTROL THE CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your loot to buy or craft special items that let you manipulate the pool, protect yourself, or sabotage your opponents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/51dc09232ef70420ed5be7d4ce8f4cbd.poster.avif?t=1773567809\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/51dc09232ef70420ed5be7d4ce8f4cbd.webm?t=1773567809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/51dc09232ef70420ed5be7d4ce8f4cbd.mp4?t=1773567809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against friends and remember: this isn't about getting the most resources \u2014 it's about <strong>survival</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The last surviving player wins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/071c1b37cc8ccf290a3053a536196c3f.poster.avif?t=1773567809\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/extras/071c1b37cc8ccf290a3053a536196c3f.webm?t=1773567809\" type=\"video/webm